Package: ptalk-signature-native
Version: 0.7.3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CTS Lab <maintainer@example.com>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-numpy, python3-picamera2, python3-libcamera, python3-requests, python3-websockets, libopus0, alsa-utils, python3-pyqt6
Recommends: qt6-wayland, fonts-noto-core, cage, pipewire-alsa, espeak-ng, wlr-randr
Description: PTalk Signature native voice/eldercare client for Raspberry Pi 5
 Native Python port of the PTalk Signature Flutter app. Real-time voice chat
 with the AI backend over WebSocket (Opus uplink via libopus/ctypes, raw PCM16
 downlink), a medicine scanner using the Pi camera (picamera2), and a
 fullscreen touch UI (PyQt6) designed for elderly users. Audio I/O uses ALSA
 (arecord/aplay); no PortAudio/sounddevice required.
